WEBVTT

1
00:00:10.600 --> 00:00:20.096
Riley: Now Whiskers is loose!

2
00:00:20.097 --> 00:00:24.445
Man: Look, that hamster is rolling on the floor!

3
00:00:24.446 --> 00:00:28.447
Woman: That's the funniest thing I ever saw.

4
00:00:28.448 --> 00:00:33.788
Nurse 1: Watch out for the frog!

5
00:00:33.789 --> 00:00:37.274
Theo: I never saw Frankie leap so high!

6
00:00:37.275 --> 00:00:40.409
Mrs. Summers: This is not the time for frog tricks.

7
00:00:40.410 --> 00:00:42.321
Snooks: Woof! Woof!

8
00:00:42.322 --> 00:00:47.307
Riley: There he goes!

9
00:00:47.308 --> 00:00:51.821
Woman: That frog jumped on my head!

10
00:00:51.822 --> 00:00:53.940
Man: Now he's off again!

11
00:00:53.941 --> 00:00:57.908
Residents: Ha-ha!

12
00:00:57.909 --> 00:01:02.524
Nurse 2: Watch out for the hamster!

13
00:01:02.525 --> 00:01:05.254
Skyler: Frankie knocked over the flowers!

14
00:01:05.255 --> 00:01:10.850
Mrs. Summers: Oh dear. They will never ask us to come back again.

15
00:01:10.851 --> 00:01:14.443
Theo: Now Frankie's up on the clock!

16
00:01:14.444 --> 00:01:16.925
Nurse 2: Can you get him down?

17
00:01:16.926 --> 00:01:21.277
Woman: He changed the time.

18
00:01:21.278 --> 00:01:31.866
Man: Now it's time for dinner. Ha-ha!

19
00:01:31.867 --> 00:01:34.167
Doctor: What is going on?

20
00:01:34.168 --> 00:01:36.182
Mrs. Summers: I'm sorry, Doctor.

21
00:01:36.183 --> 00:01:38.804
Some of our pets got loose!

22
00:01:38.805 --> 00:01:41.549
Nurse 1: It was an accident!

23
00:01:41.550 --> 00:01:44.751
Frankie: Ribbit! Ribbit!

24
00:01:44.752 --> 00:01:47.598
Sarah: Frankie is swinging on the light!

25
00:01:47.599 --> 00:01:51.283
Skyler: And Whiskers rolled into the closet.

26
00:01:51.284 --> 00:01:53.926
Doctor: Everyone, stay calm!

27
00:01:53.927 --> 00:01:56.491
Chatter: Stay calm. Wipe your feet!

28
00:01:56.492 --> 00:02:01.926
Residents: Ha-ha!

29
00:02:01.927 --> 00:02:06.004
Skyler: I caught Whiskers!

30
00:02:06.005 --> 00:02:08.345
Theo: Frankie!

31
00:02:08.346 --> 00:02:11.052
Doctor: Nothing like this ever happened before.

32
00:02:11.053 --> 00:02:13.820
A frog jumped into my pocket!

33
00:02:13.821 --> 00:02:18.170
Riley: We're sorry. Everything went wrong.

34
00:02:18.171 --> 00:02:24.982
Sarah: Yeah. We just wanted to cheer up everyone.

35
00:02:24.983 --> 00:02:27.618
Doctor: Here's your frog back.

36
00:02:27.619 --> 00:02:30.435
Riley: I guess it's time to go.

37
00:02:30.436 --> 00:02:37.563
Theo: Yeah. Or we might get into more trouble!
